  "decontamination_notes": "Real fix from marshmallow-code/marshmallow PR #2994, merged 2026-07, after model training cutoffs, so the specific fix is novel. Repo sliced at the PR's base commit 3265c13 (src/marshmallow + pyproject.toml + MIT LICENSE). marshmallow's only declared dependencies are conditional (python_version < 3.11); the base sandbox image runs 3.11+, so tests run with PYTHONPATH=src. The fix: a by-value Enum field over an enum that has a None-valued member now defaults allow_none=True unless the caller passed allow_none explicitly. Hidden tests assert observable deserialize/load behavior via the public field and Schema API, never the field's internal allow_none attribute.",
